    "description": "A business specializing in Biryani, a mixed rice dish with different regional variants originating among the Muslims of the Indian subcontinent. Popular variants of biryani include the Hyderabadi Biryani, Chettinad Biryani, Malabar Biryani and the Awadhi Biryani."
