    "description": "A business specializing in Haleem, a type of stew widely consumed by people from the Indian Subcontinent, the Middle East and Central Asia. Haleem typically includes wheat or barley as well as meat and lentils. It is prepared by blending or mashing the meat in the curry and served hot with flatbread."
